WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
I became the 10th wife of a billionaire sheikh from Qatar.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.440
Here's everything I experienced while with him that still blows my mind.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.300
After just two weeks of knowing me, he gifted me a diamond bracelet worth $150,000.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.660
He said it was to celebrate our connection.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.880
Every time he had international business meetings, he'd fly one of us to the location with him.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.320
It was always first class on his private jet, too.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.560
One weekend, he handed me a black card and told me to get new clothes.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.660
I ended up spending $60,000 in just two days.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:31.300
Each wife gets her own villa with a private garden, a personal chef, and a live-in spa therapist.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.560
My villa even has a rooftop infinity pool.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.760
He stocked our bathroom cabinets with skincare products infused with gold and caviar to keep us radiant.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.360
He insisted we take Obvi Collagenic Elite so that we could be skinny without even trying.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:49.160
I dropped 20 pounds after taking Obvi without stepping into a gym or skipping dessert, just as he requested.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:53.520
He says he's looking for an 11th wife, so comment billionaire if you want it to be you.
